# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — LA RUEDA 1975 MANAGEMENT HUB
## Enterprise Restaurant Operations & Intelligence Platform
### Powered by VEGEN Digital

## 1. PROJECT MISSION

Build a visually exceptional, modular, mobile-first restaurant management platform for **La Rueda 1975**, a prestigious restaurant with approximately 70 years of history, located in Puerto Iguazú, Misiones, Argentina.

The restaurant employs approximately 65 people and has a simultaneous seating capacity of 250 guests.

This project is being developed by **VEGEN Digital**, a consultancy specializing in business transformation, software development, process digitalization, analytics, business intelligence and AI-powered automation.

The platform must demonstrate how disconnected spreadsheets, paper checklists, manual records and fragmented workflows can evolve into an integrated digital management ecosystem.

The guiding philosophy is:

**DIGITALIZAR → REGISTRAR → RELACIONAR → ANALIZAR → DECIDIR → MEJORAR**

This is initially a **functional demonstration**, not a production rollout.

Build a comprehensive, navigable and visually compelling demonstration with realistic but entirely synthetic data. We will later decide which features to activate in production.

Do not present mock screens as working functionality. Every primary workflow implemented in the demo must actually work.

The goal is to demonstrate the potential of VEGEN Digital to transform the management of a complex restaurant organization, while preserving its culture, operational identity and personalized hospitality experience.

